An artifact found in no repository fails resolution, as does one a found artifact depends on.
--- module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
dependencies:
  - org.example:absent:1.0
  - org.example:present:1.0
--- m2/org/example/present/1.0/present-1.0.pom
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0">
  <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>
  <groupId>org.example</groupId>
  <artifactId>present</artifactId>
  <version>1.0</version>
  <dependencies>
      <dependency><groupId>org.example</groupId><artifactId>gone</artifactId><version>2.0</version></dependency>
  </dependencies>
</project>
--- krusty
ERROR: The POM or module metadata of org.example:absent:1.0 is in no local repository, and krusty-toolchain does not download artifacts
ERROR: The POM or module metadata of org.example:gone:2.0 is in no local repository, and krusty-toolchain does not download artifacts
